<title>UK: EU raises maize import duties.</title>
<headline>EU raises maize import duties.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will raise duties on transatlantic imports of maize on Thursday to 90.94 Ecus a tonne from 85.92 Ecus, European Commission figures showed.</p>
<p>Duties on imports of other grain varieties will remain unchanged.</p>
</text>
